      "message": "feat(post): add Hurco WinMax (NC) ISNC post and Hurco VM10i machine\n\nAdd clean-room Hurco WinMax (NC) ISNC 3-axis mill post\n(assets/posts/hurco-winmax.cps) and Hurco VM10i machine definition\n(assets/machines/hurco-vm10i.mch), register both in posting_files, add\npost/app pinning tests and goldens, and check every golden against the\ndocumented WinMax ISNC word set.\n\nStacked on #2506.\n\nFixes #2573",
